{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"molarity-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"molarity-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["molarity-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Molaritas adalah jumlah zat terlarut dalam mol dibagi dengan total volume larutan dalam liter. Contohnya, ZXQPH0000QXZ mol dalam ZXQPH0001QXZ L larutan adalah ZXQPH0002QXZ mol/ L (ZXQPH0003QXZ M). Gunakan volume larutan akhir, bukan volume pelarut sebelum menambahkan zat terlarut.","record_id":"28815dd53f6d554d6af376f54d879e0b2f4a66fd740e771aca90b91f88e2680b","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.2608863832499537,"source":"Molarity is the amount of solute in moles divided by the total solution volume in liters. For example, 1 mol in 2 L of solution is 0.5 mol/L (0.5 M). Use the final solution volume, not the volume of solvent before adding solute.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"7cb141aae44ff8a92ab6d76162ce5a2b4c9d18e59d5d12c5186327e785046520","status":"needs-review","translation":"Molaritas adalah jumlah zat terlarut dalam mol dibagi dengan total volume larutan dalam liter. Contohnya, 1 mol dalam 2 L larutan adalah 0.5 mol/ L (0.5 M). Gunakan volume larutan akhir, bukan volume pelarut sebelum menambahkan zat terlarut.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
